 SelectProject←{
⍝ Presents all currently opened Cider/acre projects and lets the user choose one.\\
⍝ Returns a matrix with the selected project in the same format ]Cider.Projects does, possibly `(⍬ ⍬ ⍬)`.
⍝ The mandatory left argument defines the type:
⍝ 1 = Cider
⍝ 2 = acre
⍝ 3 = Both
     type←⍺
     ~(⊂⍺)∊1 2 3:'Invalid left argument: must be either 1, 2 or 3'⎕SIGNAL 11
     l←⍵
     0=≢l:l
     caption←'SelectPrjForAPLGIT2@APLGit2: please select a',(type⊃' Cider' 'n acre' ' Cider or acre'),' project'
     0=≢i←caption ##.CommTools.Select↓⎕FMT l:'' ''
     l[i;]
 }
